        },
        {
          "text": " Nuesalito, iinacan, kiŋaiŋait yes ka aicor da kotoma Ejakait Yesu, kwape kijauniata kamakosi kwape ibusakinitor yes alosenen ka aisiyalamikinit Edeke, kwape ilosenenoto, kiyatanakinos bobo kwaŋin, ",
